<title>CANADA: Suncor Energy Q1 net slightly higher.</title>
<headline>Suncor Energy Q1 net slightly higher.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suncor Energy Inc said it earned $60 million or $1.09 per share in the first quarter, compared to $59 million or $1.08 per share a year earlier.</p>
<p>Operating earnings were $55 million versus $49 million, excluding non-operational gains of $5 million and $10 million, respectively, it said.</p>
<p>Suncor said the higher earnings were mainly due to higher commodity prices, which were partially offset by hedging activities.</p>
</text>
